Package: met4media
Type: Package
Title: Compare Metabolite Profiles of Novel Cell Culture Media
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Kathy Isaac
Maintainer: Kathy Isaac 
Description: R package that enables users to compare the metabolite profiles of novel cell culture media with those of user specified media and/or a database of publicly available commercial cell culture media.
